              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama wezi wangekujia, kama wanyang'anyi wangekujia usiku, (jinsi ulivyokatiliwa mbali!) Je! Wasingeiba kiasi cha kuwatosha? Kama wachumao zabibu wangekujia, je! Wasingeacha baadhi ya zabibu, ziokotwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jinsi watu wa Esau wanavyotafutwatafutwa! Jinsi hazina zake zilizofichwa zinavyoulizwaulizwa!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
